--- Notes ---
* SI at the display boundary: energy read as Wh on the wire, rendered kWh (Wh/1000) in tiles +
  table (web convertEnergyFromSI); duration from seconds; currency at render only (P1/S5).
* Not a live/SSE surface: the web page uses a slow-staleTime TanStack query + an explicit
  refresh mutation, not EventSource — so no SSE subscription is required for parity (ADR-013).
  The "Last synced" chip (tesla_sessions.lastSync) is the freshness surface.
* a11y: panels/charts/map/table carry accessibilityLabel/Value, headers traited, ContentUnavailableView
  empties, Dynamic Type fonts, adaptive light/dark/high-contrast tokens (Tokens.swift), >=44pt targets.
* TeslaVehicleOption renamed FleetVehicleOption to satisfy swiftlint inclusive_language
  ("te-SLAVE-hicle" substring); no other identifier triggers it.

